{"id":"893064ec9f8dc7f0","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-pr-representable-detailed.md","title":"PR Functions Representable (Detailed)","display":"thm-pr-representable-detailed — PR Functions Representable (Detailed)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-pr-representable-detailed","aliases":["92-thm-pr-representable-detailed"],"display":"thm-pr-representable-detailed — PR Functions Representable (Detailed)","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-zero-function]]","[[92-df-successor-function]]","[[92-df-projection-function]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-composition]]","[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]","[[92-thm-representability]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）","source_status":"原书表示性思想的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-pr-representable-detailed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-pr-representable-detailed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pr-representable-detailed — PR Functions Representable (Detailed)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a599a2f4a391801b\" href=\"?note=a599a2f4a391801b\" title=\"92-df-projection-function\">92-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书表示性思想的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> (zero function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (successor function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k\">\\(P_i^k\\)</span> (projection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"a599a2f4a391801b\" href=\"?note=a599a2f4a391801b\" title=\"92-df-projection-function\">92-df-projection-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_k(f)\">\\(\\Gamma_k(f)\\)</span> (paired graph-code set of a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-ary function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (typed primitive-recursive function class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\\)</span> (typed composition operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span> (primitive-recursion operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}representable\\text{-}detailed}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(1)\\ \\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_1(Z))\\land\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_1(S)),\\\\\n&amp;(2)\\ \\forall k\\geq1\\,\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_k(P_i^k)),\\\\\n&amp;(3)\\ \\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\cap(\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N)\\bigr)^m\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\bigl(\\Gamma_k(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m))\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;(4)\\ \\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall h\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\cap(\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\bigl(\\Gamma_{k+1}(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}representable\\text{-}detailed}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(1)\\ \\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_1(Z))\\land\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_1(S)),\\\\\n&amp;(2)\\ \\forall k\\geq1\\,\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_k(P_i^k)),\\\\\n&amp;(3)\\ \\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\cap(\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N)\\bigr)^m\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\bigl(\\Gamma_k(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m))\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;(4)\\ \\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall h\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\cap(\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\bigl(\\Gamma_{k+1}(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基本函数的编码图可表示；对复合与原始递归两条，前提现在要求输入函数本身属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>，从闭包性得到结果函数为PR，再表示其递归图码集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>表示：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_Z(x, y) = (y = 0)\">\\(\\varphi_Z(x, y) = (y = 0)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>表示：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_S(x, y) = (y = S(x))\">\\(\\varphi_S(x, y) = (y = S(x))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k\">\\(P_i^k\\)</span>表示：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{P}(x_1, \\ldots, x_k, y) = (y = x_i)\">\\(\\varphi_{P}(x_1, \\ldots, x_k, y) = (y = x_i)\\)</span></li>\n<li>原先仅从各图码集的逐numeral强表示推出复合图的强表示，缺少统一函数性/唯一性信息；现改用PR闭包与递归集表示定理，避免该无效推理</li>\n<li>因此所有PR函数在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本条中的旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> 仍表示正负数码定义。强可定义函数另有内部唯一输出条件，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"be5eece035332f0c\" href=\"?note=be5eece035332f0c\" title=\"92-df-strongly-definable-function\">92-df-strongly-definable-function</a>；仅配对图码可定义不能直接省去该条件。原书对角函数强可定义性在 p. 102 的 Proposition 4 明确给出。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）。</p>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"a599a2f4a391801b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb9