pt":"$S$ (successor function, see [[92-df-successor-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"a599a2f4a391801b","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P_i^k$ (projection, see [[92-df-projection-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-tuple-graph-code","status":"resolved","id":"d03aab2a94232c0e","anchor":"ref-18","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma_k(f)$ (paired graph-code set of a $k$-ary function, see [[92-df-tuple-graph-code]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","anchor":"ref-19","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (typed composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-20","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ (primitive-recursion operator, see [[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-21","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ (arithmetic-strength assumption, see [[92-df-theory-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-strongly-definable-function","status":"resolved","id":"be5eece035332f0c","anchor":"ref-22","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本条中的旧 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 仍表示正负数码定义。强可定义函数另有内部唯一输出条件，见[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]；仅配对图码可定义不能直接省去该条件。原书对角函数强可定义性在 p. 102 的 Proposition 4 明确给出。",